      "text": "Transfer to the airport for your flight to Bogotá. On arrival, transfer to your hotel."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:4c35930641001989",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "91510447dc43d28ad55079c7c480c7a2830ab1d4c0dd1bd5c8f8e12cd9861518",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-e2b3fa3e35a5",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "At the scheduled time, your English-speaking guide will take you on a sightseeing tour of Bogotá's historic centre, La Candelaria.\n\nVisit the Gold Museum, where you can see around 34,000 pre-Hispanic gold objects and more than 25,000 pre-Columbian artefacts. Next, visit the Casa de Moneda and the Botero Collection, which features work by the internationally renowned Colombian painter, draughtsman and sculptor Fernando Botero. The tour continues with a panoramic view of Plaza de Bolívar, including the cathedral, Casa de Nariño, Liévano Palace and the Palace of Justice.\n\nThe day ends with the ascent to Monserrate, followed by the return to your hotel.\n\nPlease note: The Gold Museum is closed on Mondays. The Casa de Moneda and the Botero Collection are closed on Tuesdays."
    }
